      "content": "i hear you but i honestly dont think it's that bad. i've had cramps like this before and they always go away after a massage and some electrolytes. if i take some ibuprofen and just sleep it off for a few hours, i'll probably feel way better by morning. u think that's a safe bet? i'm just so drained i can't even think straight right now.",
